# LF in the working tree on every platform. This is not a style preference:
# the booker-project round-trip tests assert that a file written back is
# byte-identical to the one read, and Git's Windows default would hand them
# CRLF and fail them for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
